---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor calls invest(amount, signature)
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: contract not paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_check_canceled: hasEnded == false
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_verify_sig: isCanceled == false
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleCanceled
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid or replayed
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_saft: signature valid from legionSigner
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_saft --> q_revert_saft: amount exceeds SAFT-approved cachedInvestAmount
    q_check_saft --> q_update_position: amount within SAFT limits
    q_revert_saft --> [*]: revert ExceedsSAFTAllocation
    q_update_position --> q_cache: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_cache --> q_transfer: position.cachedInvestAmount = saftApprovedAmount, position.cachedTokenAllocationRate = saftAllocationRate
    q_transfer --> q_mark_sig: transfer bidToken from investor to contract
    q_mark_sig --> q_update_refund: mark signature as used
    q_update_refund --> q_emit: position.refundEndTime = block.timestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount)

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: Signature must be from legionSigner and not previously used
        INV-002: Signature encodes SAFT-approved investAmount and tokenAllocationRate
        INV-003: position.investedCapital <= position.cachedInvestAmount after investment
    end note

    note right of q_update_refund
        INV-004: Each investment resets investor's individual 14-day refund window
        INV-005: refundEndTime = timestamp of last invest tx + refundPeriodSeconds
    end note
